# Trivy exceptions, read automatically by the security job in CI.
# Add an entry only after confirming the risk is acceptable and no upgrade or replacement
# is possible for now. Every entry needs a reason and an expiry date: once it expires,
# Trivy blocks again and the decision has to be made again.
#
#   # <reason / who decided / date>
#   CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-31
#
# Misconfiguration rules use their ID (for example DS-0002), licenses use the license
# name (for example LGPL-2.1-only).
